{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Cry out to Me.</b> It is not joined with \"voice.\" Likewise, \"the voice of my beloved, here he comes\" (Song of Songs 2:8) — \"my beloved\" is the subject, as I explained in the Song of Songs. The meaning is that He heard the cry of his blood that was spilled on the ground. And the translator [Onkelos] said: concerning his descendants, whom he had the power to beget."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:10.006282381Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}